  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: MagnaFingers is a Magnetic Pick-Up Hand Tool with Patented, Unique <em>Easy Release</em>. This is a clever gadget with lots of uses in a wide range of market niches.<br>&bull; Product description: <strong>Pick up annoying scattered messes and save your fingers from handling sharp items. For sewing, office, fishing/boat/sport, tech/hardware, and more. </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Strong Pick-up:</strong>&nbsp;Grab items on floor, carpet, and grass, even things you can't see, using a powerful ceramic magnet</li>\r\n<li><strong>Strong Hold:</strong>&nbsp;Hold 100 straight pins or 25 paperclips</li>\r\n<li><strong>Easy Release: </strong>Don't hurt your fingers handling sharp pins, needles, fish hooks, etc.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Simple Function: </strong>Pinch like a clothespin, with only two fingers</li>\r\n<li><strong>Releasing Pin Cushion/ Organizer:&nbsp;</strong>Drop items on it as you sew, then release when you're finished</li>\r\n<li><strong>Multi-use:</strong> Pins &amp; needles, paperclips, staples, fish hooks, lost screws, and more</li>\r\n<li><strong>Teen-Invented:&nbsp;</strong>Invented and patented by 13-year-old Owen who spilled fish hooks on his carpet.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Made in USA</strong></li>\r\n<li><strong>Free Shipping </strong>when you order 2 or more MagnaFingers</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point):&nbsp; A teen invented and patented this genius yet simple gadget. We have a unique story:&nbsp; We are a small business that began by 3D-printing these tools so that we could meet market demand right away. We printed, assembled, and sold thousands to meet customer demand before we were able to produce the current version through factory manufacturing.<br>&bull; Payment terms:&nbsp; We offer a lucrative 25% to get the word out about MagnaFingers. Shopify program alerts let us pay you promptly.<br>&bull; Other information:&nbsp; <strong><em>Thank you</em></strong> for your referrals!!</p>\r\n</div>",
